        "original_id": "253c5924-87ba-54fe-8f20-781c836621d0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Sutera, Province of Caltanissetta, Sicily, Palermo, Caltanissetta\n- Plants: Rhodotypos scandens, Rhodotypos, Kerria\n- People: Giuseppe Sorge\n- Concepts: comune, municipality, Rosaceae\n\nFacts:\n- Sutera is a comune, or municipality, in the Province of Caltanissetta in the Italian region of Sicily.\n- Sutera is located about 70 km southeast of Palermo and about 30 km west of Caltanissetta.\n- Giuseppe Sorge was born in Sutera, Sicily.\n- Rhodotypos scandens is the only species in the genus Rhodotypos.\n- Rhodotypos scandens is a deciduous shrub in the family Rosaceae.\n- Some botanists include Rhodotypos scandens in the genus Kerria because it is closely related to Kerria.",
